{"body":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"title: Pandoc Test Suite"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"author: John MacFarlane \and Anonymous"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"date: July 17, 2006"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is a set of tests for pandoc. Most of them are adapted from John Gruber's markdown test suite."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Headers"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 2 with an embedded link"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 3 with emphasis"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 5"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 2 with emphasis"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"with no blank line"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Level 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"with no blank line"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Paragraphs"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a regular paragraph."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"In Markdown 1.0.0 and earlier. Version 8. This line turns into a list item. Because a hard-wrapped line in the middle of a paragraph looked like a list item."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's one with a bullet. * criminey."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"There should be a hard line break here."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Block Quotes"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"E-mail style:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is a block quote. It is pretty short."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Code in a block quote:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sub status {
          print "working";
      }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A list:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  item one"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  item two"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Nested block quotes:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"nested"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"nested"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This should not be a block quote: 2 > 1."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Box-style:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Example:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sub status {
          print "working";
      }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  do laundry"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  take out the trash"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a nested one:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Joe said:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Don't quote me."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"And a following paragraph."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Code Blocks"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Code:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---- (should be four hyphens)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sub status {
        print "working";
    }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"this code block is indented by one tab"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"And:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"this code block is indented by two tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"These should not be escaped:  $ \\ > [ {"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"this has {two"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"lines}"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lists"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Unordered"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Asterisks tight:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Asterisks loose:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- asterisk 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pluses tight:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pluses loose:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Plus 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Minuses tight:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Minuses loose:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Minus 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ordered"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tight:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  First"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Second"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Third"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"and:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  One"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Two"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Three"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Loose using tabs:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  First"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Second"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Third"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"and using spaces:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  One"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Two"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Three"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Multiple paragraphs:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  Item 1, graf one."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Item 2."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Item 3."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Nested"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Tab"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Tab"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Tab"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's another:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  First"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Second:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Fee"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Fie"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Foe"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Third"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Same thing but with paragraphs:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  First"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  Second:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Fee"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Fie"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Foe"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.  Third"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tabs and spaces"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- this is a list item indented with tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- this is a list item indented with spaces"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- this is an example list item indented with tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- this is an example list item indented with spaces"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Fancy list markers"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. begins with 2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2. and now 3"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. sublist with roman numerals, starting with 4"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2. more items"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. a subsublist"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2. a subsublist"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Nesting:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. Upper Alpha"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. Upper Roman."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. Decimal start with 6"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. Lower alpha with paren"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Autonumbering:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  Autonumber."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.  More."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.  Nested."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Should not be a list item:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"M.A. 2007"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B. Williams"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Definition Lists"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tight using spaces:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- apple: red fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- orange: orange fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- banana: yellow fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tight using tabs:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- apple: red fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- orange: orange fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- banana: yellow fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Loose:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- apple: red fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- orange: orange fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- banana: yellow fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Multiple blocks with italics:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- apple: red fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- orange: orange fruit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HTML Blocks"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Simple block on one line:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"foo"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"And nested without indentation:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"foo"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bar"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Interpreted markdown in a table:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is emphasized"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"And this is strong"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a simple block:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"foo"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This should be a code block, though:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<div>
        foo
    </div>"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"As should this:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<div>foo</div>"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Now, nested:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"foo"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This should just be an HTML comment:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Multiline:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Code block:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<!-- Comment -->"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Just plain comment, with trailing spaces on the line:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Code:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<hr />"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hr's:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Inline Markup"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is emphasized, and so is this."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong, and so is this."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"An emphasized link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong and em."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"So is this word."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strong and em."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"So is this word."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is code: >, $, \, $, <html>."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This is strikeout."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Superscripts: abcd"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ahello ahello there."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Subscripts: H2O, H23O,"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hmany of themO."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"These should not be superscripts or subscripts, because of the unescaped spaces: a^b c^d, a\simb c\simd."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Smart quotes, ellipses, dashes"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""Hello," said the spider. " 'Shelob' is my name.""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"'A', 'B', and 'C' are letters."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"'Oak,' 'elm,' and 'beech' are names of trees. So is 'pine.'"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"'He said, "I want to go." ' Were you alive in the 70's?"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is some quoted 'code' and a "quoted link"."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Some dashes: one—two—three—four—five."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Dashes between numbers: 5–7, 255–66, 1987–1999."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ellipses…and…and…."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LaTeX"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- smith.1899"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $2+2=4$"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $x \in y$"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $\alpha \wedge \omega$"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $223$"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $p$-Tree"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $\frac{d}{dx}f(x)=\lim_{h\to 0}\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}$"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Here's one that has a line break in it: $\alpha + \omega \times x^2$."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"These shouldn't be math:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- To get the famous equation, write $e = mc^2$."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- $22,000 is a lot of money. So is $34,000. (It worked if "lot" is emphasized.)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- Escaped $: $73 this should be emphasized 23$."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a LaTeX table:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Animal   Number
  -------- --------
  Dog      2
  Cat      1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A table with one column:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-----------
    Animal
   Vegetable
  -----------"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Special Characters"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is some unicode:"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- I hat: Î"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- o umlaut: ö"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- section: §"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- set membership: ∈"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- copyright: ©"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AT&T has an ampersand in their name."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AT&T is another way to write it."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This & that."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4 < 5."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6 > 5."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Backslash: \"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Backtick: '"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Asterisk: *"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Underscore: _"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Left brace: {"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Right brace: }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Left bracket: ["},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Right bracket: ]"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Left paren: ("},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Right paren: )"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Greater-than: >"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hash: #"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Period: ."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bang: !"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Plus: +"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Minus: -"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Links"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Explicit"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Just a URL."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL and title."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL and title."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL and title."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL and title"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"URL and title"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"with_underscore"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Email link"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Empty."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Reference"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Foo bar."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Foo bar."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Foo bar."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"With embedded [brackets]."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"b by itself should be a link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Indented once."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Indented twice."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Indented thrice."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This should [not][] be a link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[not]: /url"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Foo bar."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Foo biz."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"With ampersands"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a link with an ampersand in the URL."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's a link with an amersand in the link text: AT&T."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's an inline link."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here's an inline link in pointy braces."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Autolinks"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"With an ampersand: http://example.com/?foo=1&bar=2"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- In a list?"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- http://example.com/"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- It should."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"An e-mail address: nobody@nowhere.net"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Blockquoted: http://example.com/"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Auto-links should not occur here: <http://example.com/>"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"or here: <http://example.com/>"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Images"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"From "Voyage dans la Lune" by Georges Melies (1902):"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[image: lalune.jpg]"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[image: movie.jpg]"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Footnotes"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Here is a footnote reference, { Here is the footnote. It can go anywhere after the footnote reference. It need not be placed at the end of the document. }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"and another. { Here's the long note. This one contains multiple blocks."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Subsequent blocks are indented to show that they belong to the footnote (as with list items)."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"{ <code> }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If you want, you can indent every line, but you can also be lazy and just indent the first line of each block. }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This should not be a footnote reference, because it contains a space.[^my note] Here is an inline note. { This is easier to type. Inline notes may contain links and ] verbatim characters, as well as [bracketed text]. }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Notes can go in quotes. { In quote. }"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1. And in list items. In list."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"This paragraph should not be part of the note, as it is not indented."},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Escaped characters"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"$ % & # _ { }"}]}
